om&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTCgTQG0McRe2owPDjiZOzWmeKTnyK52dEJ_Ngkg3VROA&oe=6B046ADD"}, {"file_name": "nomad_store_05_target_range.png", "id": "1064370423254991", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1064370433254990_8300007350378005738_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X-123s5tsqoQ7kNvwGlRzHx&_nc_oc=Ado5NUxRH7yAjYp8Zwmk4A3TUO6zkwTMk-6WMLh0HmcjU5CrCXurF2jdiMx0tTAR2iw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQd6yn8PccMHRP5r8WS-3K4c5QEC0ztjzYGupsf96Z5Ag&oe=6B04658F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nomad_shooter_exact_2560x1440_24bit.png", "id": "1650210489964847", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1650210496631513_7793386767145659260_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i5Piyp-CkQcQ7kNvwG7F9Y2&_nc_oc=AdohF3JTIypmnG2n-mvudYfE2024FVxAWb88PAAJKNH_t7hN4QzWILVhSAWs-dPqTTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAcnLl46czJ6u4GnK1RKGzSqJflLk5Idiim-cnGj-01A&oe=6B046F27"}, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a